whatever goal you want,

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:58.204
not only on the court,
but off it, too.

00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:00.081
All right.
The sky is the limit for you.

00:09:00.081 --> 00:09:01.707
Peace and love.
- Yeah, that's my guy.

00:09:01.707 --> 00:09:02.708
