00:09:07.046 --> 00:09:08.297
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:09:08.297 --> 00:09:09.715
- So you guys have a pretty
special relationship?

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:12.635
- Pretty good relationship,
yeah.

00:09:12.635 --> 00:09:13.511
- [Taylor:] All right.

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:16.264
