and for the 5,

00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:22.181
I would say Anthony Davis,
but I gotta take

00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:23.474
Greek Freak.

00:11:23.474 --> 00:11:25.226
- [Taylor:] Ooh, OK.

00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:27.812
Why choose Giannis over AD?

00:11:27.812 --> 00:11:30.272
- Because when they both was
with their own team, like,

00:11:30.272 --> 00:11:32.900
