00:12:04.724 --> 00:12:06.809
I got three scorers
outside the paint: me,

00:12:06.809 --> 00:12:08.519
Luka and Jayson Tatum.
- [Taylor:] Mmhmm.

00:12:08.519 --> 00:12:11.439
- Like, those two guys are
prolific scorers, if you ask me.

00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:12.982
Zion, you can't stop him
in the paint.

00:12:12.982 --> 00:12:15.067
The only person that could
stop him probably is LeBron,

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:16.902
and Bam Adebayo,
I feel like he's the best

00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:19.530
