there is in the league.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:21.157
- [Announcer:]
Bam Adebayo, look out!

00:12:21.157 --> 00:12:24.076
- Do you think about what kind
of NBA player you wanna be

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:26.412
