you wanna have?

00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:27.496
- If I could pick now,

00:12:27.496 --> 00:12:29.165
I probably would say
Dwyane Wade.

00:12:29.165 --> 00:12:30.458
- [Taylor:] OK. Why Dwyane?

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:32.585
- [Anthony:] I just felt like he
was great in the NBA, like–

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.086
- [Taylor:] Yeah?

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:35.254
- [Anthony:]
He did a lotta great things,

00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:37.214
and I love, like, when he hit
buzzer-beaters,

00:12:37.214 --> 00:12:39.008
he'd go stand on top
of the little thing.

00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:40.176
- [Taylor:] The scorer's table,
yeah.

00:12:40.176 --> 00:12:41.010
- [Anthony:] Yeah.
I love that.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.804
- And I know you have a good
relationship with D-Wade.

00:12:43.804 --> 00:12:44.346
