How does this happen?

00:12:46.265 --> 00:12:49.393
Like, how do you become good
friends with these guys?

00:12:49.393 --> 00:12:51.479
You talk to Victor, I assume,
cuz of [Tom] Crean.

00:12:51.479 --> 00:12:53.397
- Yeah.
- You talk to D-Wade.

00:12:53.397 --> 00:12:54.690
How do you form
these relationships,

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.234
